      "writtenOn": "2025-01-21T17:25:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is the question about how to get soong to compile an assembly file?  Adding a `.S` to `srcs` should just work: https://source.corp.google.com/h/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:art/runtime/Android.bp;l\u003d496?q\u003dquick_entrypoints_arm64.S%20file:art\u0026sq\u003drepo:android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20b:main.",
      "parentUuid": "ed7d5817_c3ee8fa2",
      "revId": "18a28b4401f0304b0b97ec1715a327b8af8d1ffc",
