      "writtenOn": "2025-01-21T20:08:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We need to compile an assembly file with a custom define that points to a file. asflags in the example above shows pass a flag, but I don\u0027t know if it can reference a file the same way this cc_genrule does, `$(in)`.",
      "parentUuid": "d8774873_4cac2dd7",
      "revId": "18a28b4401f0304b0b97ec1715a327b8af8d1ffc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
