      "writtenOn": "2025-01-22T09:48:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e ...genrule use sed s\"MANIFEST_DATA\"$(in)\" to rewrite the .S file with the path.\n\nYou\u0027re right, this is possible but also quite hacky. I tried it as well, and we still need a `genrule` instead of directly compiling the `.S` file within `cc_object`.\n\nOtherwise, to keep things moving, could we merge the current cl first to unblock Armelle\u0027s work? We can address the refactoring of those four lines in a separate thread, that would allow us to make progress on both fronts without unnecessary delays.\n\nCC @armellel@google.com",
