      "writtenOn": "2025-01-22T18:46:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m OK with merging the current CL for now. I think it would be useful to have a follow up CL to fix the problem Colin described, so future soong changes don\u0027t suddenlt break this. I don\u0027t think generating the .C file with sed accomlish that though. I think the genrule needs to generate the security_vm_signed_obj file.",
