        "id": 1000205
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-23T18:38:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think the static_lib is the main issue. The issue is that the cc_object rule does not know that the .S file is using the $(in) file that this rule got, and the build system does not guarantee that it will be accessible in the same location in an different rule. `trusty/kernel/app/trusty/user-tasks.mk` in the trusty build, which does a similar task, is similar to a genrule manually invoking the compiler on a .S file where it has access the path it needs to pass in. The question for @ccross@android.com is: does genrule have something similar to `$(CC)` in make. It might look different though.",
      "parentUuid": "0343a83a_9c3aa1ae",
      "revId": "18a28b4401f0304b0b97ec1715a327b8af8d1ffc",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
